{"version":1,"content":"<p>前港姐冠軍林鈺洧（Denice）身材高挑且擁有迷人曲線，向來不吝嗇在社交平台大派福利，昨日她分享了一組於法國巴黎拍攝的街頭美照，並興奮配文：「第一次來到巴黎，這裏的一切都如我所願，亞歷山大三世橋上的黃金時刻魔力。</p><p>」從照片中可見，Denice</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:43.309534+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T01:01:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"df919be6426d1108a506b5342d2f38bbc34f227f7ba786975be87eb3872c4406","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}